SUMMARY:PRS Database: rule starts for the West Midlands (draft)
DESCRIPTION:PRS Database dates for the West Midlands. Rule starts: 15 Decem
 ber 2026. Register by: 14 March 2027.\n\nThe start date is in the draft Pr
 ivate Rented Sector Database Regulations 2026. The register-by date come
 s from Government guidance on the Housing Hub. We last checked both on 3 O
 ctober 2026. The regulations were still draft then\, so the dates could ch
 ange.\n\nCheck before you rely on these dates.\nGuide: https://innovatedig
 i.github.io/landlord-tracker/guides/prs-database-west-midlands/\nOfficia
 l page: https://housinghub.campaign.gov.uk/renting-is-changing/get-ready-t
 o-register/\n\nThis is general information\, not legal advice. Innovate Di
 gital is an independent business and is not affiliated with Innovate UK o
 r UKRI.
URL:https://innovatedigi.github.io/landlord-tracker/guides/prs-database-wes
 t-midlands/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
